// array_insert into a resizable array whose count says it has elements
// but whose data is null (issue #158, spec 3.17, 8.4): that count claims
// elements no memory holds, so the built-in stops as indexing such a view
// would, at its name, rather than inserting among elements nothing wrote.
main :: () {
    a : [..]int;
    a.count = 2;
    array_insert(*a, 1, 5);
}
